# Purpose: Remove ANSI SGR color sequences so log text can be searched and attached to a plain-text report.
# Inputs: colored-build.log: UTF-8 text containing ANSI SGR color escapes.
# Outputs: stdout: The same readable text without SGR color escapes.
accept colored_build_path as text with default "colored-build.log"
run cat with path colored_build_path
then sed with program "s/\u001b\\[[0-9;]*m//g"
